Reads public data from Smart Citizen (Fab Lab Barcelona) and Bali Air Dispatch and its upstream networks
(Nafas, IQAir, PurpleAir, AQICN, OpenAQ, AirGradient, Airly). Those readings remain under their providers' terms;
anything published from them must credit the archive and the originating network.

The EPA 2021 humidity correction implements Barkjohn et al. (2021) as extended by US EPA (2022).
